<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM TEXAS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM TEXAS.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the suspended first round of the Byron Nelson Classic golf tournament on Thursday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>(Play suspended due to darkness) 63: Jim Furyk. 64: Dudley Hart, Paul Stankowski, Tiger Woods. 65: Tom Watson, Lee Rinker, Eric Johnson, Kevin Sutherland, Chris Perry, Brad Bryant. 66: Craig Parry (Australia), Doug Martin, Justin Leonard, Andrew Magee, Rocco Mediate, P.H. Horgan III, Mike Standly, Phil Mickelson, Nick Faldo (Britain), Ben Crenshaw.</p>
<p>Add regional scores:</p>
<p>68 David Frost (South Africa)</p>
<p>69 Joe Ozaki (Japan), Nick Price (South Africa)</p>
<p>71 Sandy Lyle (Scotland)</p>
<p>72 Bradley Hughes (Australia)</p>
<p>77 Fulton Allem (South Africa)</p>
</text>
